      "message": "interceptKeyBeforeQueueing does not dispatch the global key. If the global key is not in global_keys.xml it will block these keys, but if the key is it simply passes for interceptSystemKeysAndShortcuts (this code) to handle it https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/services/core/java/com/android/server/policy/PhoneWindowManager.java;l\u003d4668\n\nHowever, since interceptSystemkeysAndShortcuts does not dispatch global keys till after this wtf check, effectively adding keys to global_keys.xml simply causes them to trigger this wtf rather than actually dispatch to apps.\n\nThe dispatching is happening here: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/services/core/java/com/android/server/policy/PhoneWindowManager.java;l\u003d3794 ,the bottom of the method doing this switch statement (right above where we moved this WTF check down too)",
